        // To comply with the requirement of exactly one assertion that observes c, rewrite as the intended universal property:
        // Only admin can change owner, so for this non-admin caller the call must not succeed and owner must remain unchanged.
        // Implement that as a single proper assertTrue observing c.owner():
    }
